      "content": "she turns 14 today. i sent a card two weeks ago just in case she needed time to think about whether she wanted to respond. nothing. not even a text\n\ni've been sober 6 years, i have a job, i go to therapy, i show up every time a court allows me to send something. and she still doesn't want to know me. \n\ni don't know why i keep fighting for a life she doesn't want me to be part of",
